  "description": "Search Plus for Umbraco 17 and 18: synonym management, query expansion, and diacritics-insensitive search enhancements managed from the backoffice. Adds a \"uTPro Feature\" group in the Settings section sidebar with full CRUD UI for synonym groups.",
