  "published": "2026-11-07T10:24:55.03Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.1.1 / v18.1.1: Version lines now follow the Umbraco major (17.x for Umbraco 17, 18.x for Umbraco 18) and each line's Umbraco.Cms.Api.Management dependency is boxed to a single major - [17.0.0, 18.0.0) and [18.0.0, 19.0.0) respectively. Previously a single net10.0 build declared [17.0.0, 19.0.0), which let a host pinned to Umbraco 17 be pulled up to Umbraco 18 whenever another package in the project graph demanded 18. Boxing the range per major prevents that cross-major drift: installing into an Umbraco 17 site always resolves the 17.x line and never forces an 18 upgrade. Umbraco 16 (the old net9.0 target) is no longer supported. No functional, API, UI or database changes - this is a packaging/compatibility change only. v1.1.0: CSV import & export. Export every synonym group from the backoffice (toolbar button or GET /export) and bulk-import with merge or replace-all modes; duplicates are skipped using diacritics-insensitive comparison. No breaking API changes. v1.0.0: Initial release. Synonym management UI in Settings sidebar, diacritics-insensitive Examine index (ASCIIFoldingFilter), 25 pre-loaded synonym groups, REST API, automatic integration with uTPro.Extension.Search.",
